566724b","maturity":"draft","page_type":"entity","path":"pages/entities/prasenjeet-symon-ogcode-659b6566724b.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":[],"title":"prasenjeet-symon/ogcode","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:32:23Z","updated_by_operation":"op_f38c9d0e965f4733ba032d69ee84628a"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_0f4382dabd79d66905e287e397364e408d54dc1be79a5c1fe9e959fd7b34ce0b"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The README claims Agentic Session Memory recalls only task-relevant facts from a persistent knowledge graph per turn instead of replaying the full transcript, keeping per-turn prompt size flat."},{"claim_ids":["clm_125fa3b06e8dc9b4e6048947771e1d7926bf2d22a17a77b907be45af71e95423"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Plan Mode breaks a locked plan into tasks with effort estimates (S/M/L/XL), complexity scores, and a dependency graph, shown on a visual Kanban board before execution."},{"claim_ids":["clm_405e8bfd426ffbf404fd7572f7b141f3b343a50070653ce8fc336c2453eb4218"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Ten tree-sitter grammars cover Go, TypeScript/JS/TSX, PHP, Python, Rust, Swift, Java, C#, and Dart, with a heuristic fallback scanner for other file types."},{"claim_ids":["clm_472c0be01f5bd9f01a31d4217e80a0ce568f78cedff89eb20df3773f69be2bd6"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"A file_map tool uses tree-sitter to outline declarations with line ranges; reading a file over 200 lines without a range returns the map instead of full contents."},{"claim_ids":["clm_505827ab5ea1c8887601377dc4da79b091f72e6bcac3d0ca0bde5bcad6ec8d2f"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Skills are SKILL.md files whose names and descriptions appear in the prompt; the full body is loaded via a skill tool only when a task matches."},{"claim_ids":["clm_54542cfc94f3e49ee223333424415c484741de372b8afb9228a4ae81bc70b8b9"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"A knowledge graph structured as Topic → Concept → Fact is said to persist across sessions as semantic memory of the codebase."},{"claim_ids":["clm_76094fe45afbb093411ac22c1d98d5d8e1700135ed0c32aa3efde839216f1a46"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Configuration layers CLI flag > environment variable > config file > provider auto-detect, supporting Anthropic, OpenAI, OpenRouter, and Ollama via env vars and optional JSON config files."},{"claim_ids":["clm_930cb2b45360f9b94807d9dcb896507d3d82e54028041b147a5b11e246cd716b"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The Swift tree-sitter grammar is vendored into the repository rather than required via go.mod, and the Dart grammar is pinned to a commit pseudo-version because it lacks tagged releases."},{"claim_ids":["clm_cc4d64b81a3769e7ff6c4001ea6bc26890961e9e46752d9dac3ab8a2563be5bd"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The breakdown agent enforces a file-ownership rule so parallel tasks never edit the same files, and dependency chains are strictly linear with cycles rejected before execution."},{"claim_ids":["clm_de7aa1fc67b50c9907acc5d8d4b38bb5d8333e15f88cb6a7fd3ae482582d2865"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Each task runs in its own git worktree and isolated agent session; independent tasks execute in parallel, and finished tasks auto-commit, push, and open PRs via the gh CLI idempotently."},{"claim_ids":["clm_f357e737691894ed2370e5c4eaba872aa0185b2fb2fcf5e0253a21dff7bb089a"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The README reports session-level token savings of 68–76% versus full-replay at 50–1000 message lengths, attributing accuracy gains to curated context; these are self-reported figures."},{"claim_ids":["clm_f695b974c4c5d93522680b1b6f877e87e719b29a5b9a827af3845763c3e6a17c"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Ogcode is described as a single Go binary with an embedded SolidJS web UI that runs locally, positioned as browser-native, self-hosted, and model-agnostic."}],"claim_ids":["clm_0f4382dabd79d66905e287e397364e408d54dc1be79a5c1fe9e959fd7b34ce0b","clm_125fa3b06e8dc9b4e6048947771e1d7926bf2d22a17a77b907be45af71e95423","clm_405e8bfd426ffbf404fd7572f7b141f3b343a50070653ce8fc336c2453eb4218","clm_472c0be01f5bd9f01a31d4217e80a0ce568f78cedff89eb20df3773f69be2bd6","clm_505827ab5ea1c8887601377dc4da79b091f72e6bcac3d0ca0bde5bcad6ec8d2f","clm_54542cfc94f3e49ee223333424415c484741de372b8afb9228a4ae81bc70b8b9","clm_76094fe45afbb093411ac22c1d98d5d8e1700135ed0c32aa3efde839216f1a46","clm_930cb2b45360f9b94807d9dcb896507d3d82e54028041b147a5b11e246cd716b","clm_cc4d64b81a3769e7ff6c4001ea6bc26890961e9e46752d9dac3ab8a2563be5bd","clm_de7aa1fc67b50c9907acc5d8d4b38bb5d8333e15f88cb6a7fd3ae482582d2865","clm_f357e737691894ed2370e5c4eaba872aa0185b2fb2fcf5e0253a21dff7bb089a","clm_f695b974c4c5d93522680b1b6f877e87e719b29a5b9a827af3845763c3e6a17c"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T02:32:23Z","created_by_operation":"op_f38c9d0e965f4733ba032d69ee84628a","id":"pg_5e17066cf5d65d3faa5768514d31d270","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/prasenjeet-symon-ogcode-readme-md-e76eaf72178d-68514d31d270.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_31317f9f827753fc9b24c8335ca2abdd"],"title":"prasenjeet-symon/ogcode/README.md @ e76eaf72178d","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:32:23Z","updated_by_operation":"op_f38c9d0e965f4733ba032d69ee84628a"}
